{"help": "https://www.envidat.ch/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"author": "[{\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"data_credit\": [\"collection\", \"validation\", \"curation\", \"software\", \"publication\", \"supervision\"], \"email\": \"caviezel@slf.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Andrin\", \"identifier\": \"0000-0001-6249-4913\", \"name\": \"Caviezel\"}, {\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"data_credit\": [\"collection\", \"validation\"], \"email\": \"sophia@wyssen.com\", \"given_name\": \"Sophia\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"Demmel\"}, {\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"data_credit\": \"collection\", \"email\": \"buehler@slf.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Yves\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"B\\u00fchler\"}, {\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"data_credit\": [\"collection\", \"validation\", \"publication\"], \"email\": \"ringenbach@slf.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Adrian\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"Ringenbach\"}, {\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"data_credit\": \"collection\", \"email\": \"christen@slf.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Marc\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"Christen\"}, {\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"affiliation_02\": \"\", \"affiliation_03\": \"\", \"data_credit\": [\"collection\", \"publication\", \"supervision\"], \"email\": \"bartelt@slf.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Perry\", \"identifier\": \"\", \"name\": \"Bartelt\"}]", "author_email": null, "creator_user_id": "e4badad3-369f-401e-8582-a22277078505", "date": "[{\"date\": \"2017-06-14\", \"date_type\": \"created\", \"end_date\": \"2020-10-31\"}]", "doi": "10.16904/envidat.174", "funding": "[{\"grant_number\": \"\", \"institution\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"institution_url\": \"\"}]", "id": "71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662", "isopen": false, "language": "en", "license_id": "wsl-data", "license_title": "WSL Data Policy", "license_url": "https://www.wsl.ch/en/about-wsl/programmes-and-initiatives/envidat.html", "maintainer": "{\"affiliation\": \"WSL Institute for Snow and Avalanche Research SLF\", \"email\": \"caviezel@slf.ch\", \"given_name\": \"Andrin\", \"identifier\": \"0000-0001-6249-4913\", \"name\": \"Caviezel\"}", "maintainer_email": null, "metadata_created": "2019-11-19T13:18:06.145158", "metadata_modified": "2026-09-11T13:06:24.411697", "name": "induced-rockfall-dataset-chant-sura", "notes": "The data archive contains site specific geographical data such as DEM and orthophoto as well as the deposition points of manually induced rockfall by releasing differently shaped boulders with 46, 200, 800 and 2670 kg of mass. \r\n\r\nAdditionally available are all the reconstructed data sets for all trajectories with videogrammetry installed comprising StoneNode data streams for rocks equipped with a sensor. The data set consists of:\r\n\r\n# Resources (individual zip-archives)\r\n\r\n__ExperimentalRuns__:  Archive with all available StoneNode data streams and its respective figure (.mat files)\r\n\r\n__Input__: Archive containing folders \r\n\r\n* GNSS: 182 Deposition points of all different weight and shape classes, shape files for release point, cliff and scree line, \r\n* UAS: UAS generated pre- and post-experimental digital surface models and orthophoto of the four most important experimental days and \r\n* VG_Coord: Reconstruction input: Videogrammetry based coordinate list along side with the corresponding sensor/video times\r\n\r\n__EOTA__: Point cloud of cubic EOTA(111) and platy EOTA(221) rock as input for RAMMS::ROCKFALL or other suitable rockfall simulation codes incorporating complex shape files.\r\n\r\n__Output__: Reconstruced trajectory information for all 82 reconstructed trajectories\r\n\r\n__Video__: available video streams for all runs\r\n\r\n\r\n## Further information \r\nPreceeding publications concering the deployed sensors and the reconstruction methods are found in the subsequent references:\r\n\r\nA. Caviezel et al., Design and Evaluation of a Low-Power Sensor Device for Induced Rockfall Experiments, IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement, 2018, 67, 767-779, http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/8122020/\r\nP. Niklaus et al., StoneNode: A low-power sensor device for induced rockfall experiments, 2017 IEEE Sensors Applications Symposium (SAS), 2017, 1-6, http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/7894081/\r\n\r\nCaviezel, A., Demmel, S. E., Ringenbach, A., B\u00fchler, Y., Lu, G., Christen, M., Dinneen, C. E., Eberhard, L. A., von Rickenbach, D., and Bartelt, P.: Reconstruction of four-dimensional rockfall trajectories using remote sensing and rock-based accelerometers and gyroscopes, Earth Surf. Dynam., 7, 199\u2013210, https://doi.org/10.5194/esurf-7-199-2019, 2019", "num_resources": 5, "num_tags": 9, "organization": {"id": "a17b145f-2191-4c21-aabf-55661d5cb140", "name": "slf-snow-avalanches-and-prevention", "title": "Snow Avalanches and Prevention", "type": "organization", "description": "This research unit investigates the formation and dynamics of avalanches in order to improve the forecasting of when and where avalanche events are likely to occur and their effects. It engages in process modelling based on laboratory experiments and field investigations.\r\n\r\nOn behalf of the government, it also operates the Swiss avalanche warning service. The avalanche bulletin provides information concerning the current avalanche situation and warns the public about the avalanche danger. The data underlying the service is delivered by an extensive network of observers and automatic measuring stations. The avalanches and prevention unit develops warning and information systems for public authorities and local emergency services.\r\n\r\nAmong other key duties, the unit provides advice on practical aspects of avalanche protection, and develops methods for the risk-based management of natural hazards. The latest research and development findings are continuously being translated into practice and used in the unit's intensive teaching and training activities.\r\n\r\nIt works closely together with other SLF research units and partners in Switzerland and abroad. These include national and international research establishments, cantonal and federal authorities, as well as industry, associations, and agencies responsible for public safety and tourism.", "image_url": "", "created": "2016-05-24T16:15:21.861195", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "a17b145f-2191-4c21-aabf-55661d5cb140", "private": false, "publication": "{\"publication_year\": \"2020\", \"publisher\": \"EnviDat\"}", "publication_state": "published", "related_datasets": "", "related_publications": "", "resource_type": "dataset", "resource_type_general": "dataset", "spatial": "{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[9.963292776374146,46.740181869246406],[9.963292776374146,46.750062797556026],[9.974364935187621,46.750062797556026],[9.974364935187621,46.740181869246406],[9.963292776374146,46.740181869246406]]]}", "spatial_info": "Switzerland", "state": "active", "subtitle": "", "title": "Induced Rockfall Dataset #2 (Chant Sura Experimental Campaign), Fl\u00fcelapass, Grisons, Switzerland", "type": "dataset", "url": null, "version": "1.0", "extras": [{"key": "dora_link", "value": ""}], "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2019-11-19T13:18:54.282121", "description": "Compressed archive with the StoneNode experimental runs and the respective figures. Matlab format.", "doi": "", "format": "*.zip", "hash": "", "id": "d9c77b83-fd15-414c-a257-461e6d2b2545", "last_modified": "2020-09-16T10:24:10.518708", "metadata_modified": "2021-10-21T13:20:55.134959", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Experimental Runs Archive", "package_id": "71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662", "position": 0, "publication_state": "", "resource_size": "{\"size_units\": \"kb\", \"size_value\": \"\"}", "resource_type": null, "restricted": "{\"level\": \"public\", \"allowed_users\": \"\"}", "size": 538660719, "state": "active", "url": "https://www.envidat.ch/dataset/71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662/resource/d9c77b83-fd15-414c-a257-461e6d2b2545/download/experimentalruns.7z", "url_type": "upload"}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2020-09-16T12:29:30.191162", "description": "", "doi": "", "format": "ZIP", "hash": "", "id": "a8a12374-c28c-4248-96f8-c993be6d411d", "last_modified": null, "metadata_modified": "2026-09-11T13:06:14.712418", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Input Archive", "package_id": "71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662", "position": 1, "publication_state": "", "resource_size": "{\"size_units\": \"gb\", \"size_value\": \"11\"}", "resource_type": null, "restricted": "{\"level\": \"public\", \"allowed_users\": \"\"}", "size": null, "state": "active", "url": "https://zhc-c.s3.cloud.switch.ch/envidat-doi/10.16904_envidat.174/data/caviezel_et_al_2020/Input.7z", "url_type": ""}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2020-09-16T12:30:02.237456", "description": "Data under embargo: Trajectory reconstruction tables", "doi": "", "format": "ZIP", "hash": "", "id": "a2e218f8-cffe-4c6a-8515-01a0ff704524", "last_modified": "2020-09-17T12:39:43.546296", "metadata_modified": "2021-10-21T13:22:04.351563", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Output Archive", "package_id": "71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662", "position": 2, "publication_state": "", "resource_size": "{\"size_units\": \"kb\", \"size_value\": \"\"}", "resource_type": null, "restricted": "{\"level\": \"public\", \"allowed_users\": \"\"}", "size": 4736837, "state": "active", "url": "https://www.envidat.ch/dataset/71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662/resource/a2e218f8-cffe-4c6a-8515-01a0ff704524/download/output.7z", "url_type": "upload"}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2020-09-16T12:30:38.037493", "description": "", "doi": "", "format": ".zip", "hash": "", "id": "6190ea59-8f2b-49a9-8fd6-76e77c230a87", "last_modified": null, "metadata_modified": "2026-09-11T13:06:24.416690", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Video Archive", "package_id": "71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662", "position": 3, "publication_state": "", "resource_size": "{\"size_units\": \"gb\", \"size_value\": \"5\"}", "resource_type": null, "restricted": "{\"level\": \"public\", \"allowed_users\": \"\"}", "size": null, "state": "active", "url": "https://zhc-c.s3.cloud.switch.ch/envidat-doi/10.16904_envidat.174/data/caviezel_et_al_2020/Video.7z", "url_type": ""}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2020-12-08T13:45:58.136129", "description": "Cubic EOTA(111) and platy EOTA(221) point cloud.", "doi": "", "format": "application/x-7z-compressed", "hash": "", "id": "eaa94cfe-a85f-4c26-ad2a-2f53b9e4af56", "last_modified": "2020-12-08T13:45:57.895453", "metadata_modified": "2021-10-21T13:22:22.668377", "mimetype": null, "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "EOTA", "package_id": "71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662", "position": 4, "publication_state": "", "resource_size": "{\"size_units\": \"kb\", \"size_value\": \"\"}", "resource_type": null, "restricted": "{\"level\": \"public\", \"allowed_users\": \"\"}", "size": 419, "state": "active", "url": "https://www.envidat.ch/dataset/71e65311-b0dd-48df-acfc-791c99cb0662/resource/eaa94cfe-a85f-4c26-ad2a-2f53b9e4af56/download/eota.7z", "url_type": "upload"}], "tags": [{"display_name": "DEM", "id": "ea1